# The build artifact. This file lives IN tools/uipreview/, so the pattern is
# just the name — it used to read "uipreview/uipreview", which resolves to
# tools/uipreview/uipreview/uipreview and therefore matched nothing. That is
# how a 121 KB binary came to be committed at cb6dd81.
/uipreview

# The rendered screens ARE committed on purpose: they are what a design change
# gets reviewed against, so a diff that shows them moving is the point.
